    "ge-trumian. Add: (1) intrans. :-- Þú getrumast convalescas, Wrt. Voc. ii. 15, 75. Hé þǽre ealdan untrumnesse getrumad wæs ueterno infirmitatis discusso, Bd. 5, 5; Sch. 572, 10. (2) reflex. :-- Þá getrumade ic mé and gestrangad wæs convalui, 5, 6; Sch. 581, 11.",
